// Their coil is their gust minus their momentum ("n/a" while either is "n/a").
// The sheet's region counts show, for each region its people have, how many of them are in it
// (a person counts once in every region they belong to), ordered by region code.
// Each count is also the region's tally (region-tally-<code>), the same number.
// The sheet's top per region shows, for each region its people have, the name of the person in it with
// the highest scaled, ties going to the name earlier in the alphabet ("n/a" when none of them have a scaled).
// Each person may follow any number of other people, chosen on the row; following is one-directional,
// so A following B does not make B follow A. A person's allies are the people they follow, listed by name, with how many there are,
// and their synergy: the allies' thrust added together (zero without allies).
// Their combined is their influence plus their synergy ("n/a" while either is "n/a").
// Each person may have a single whole-number score, set on the row. Their note sum is their score (zero
// otherwise "no" (also "no" while their ebb is "n/a").
// The sheet's stray count is how many of its people are strays.
// The sheet's final total is the sum of the scaled of its people whose state is FINAL, counting
// "n/a" as zero.
// The sheet's ledger is the grand total of everyone's scaled, leaving out anyone whose scaled is "n/a".
// The sheet's tier tally shows how many of its people are in each tier, SURGE, STEADY and SINK (zero when
// none are); people without a tier are not counted.
// The sheet's tier ledger shows the total scaled of its people in each tier, SURGE, STEADY and SINK (zero
// when none are); people without a tier, or whose scaled is "n/a", add nothing.
// The sheet's stratum counts show how many of its people are in each stratum, TOP and BOT (zero when
// none are); people whose stratum is "n/a" are not counted.
            </li>
          }
        </ul>
      }
    </section>
    <section aria-labelledby="region-apex-heading">
      <h2 id="region-apex-heading">Top per region</h2>
      @if (regionApexes().length === 0) {
        <p>No regions yet.</p>
      } @else {
        <ul>
          @for (r of regionApexes(); track r.region) {
            <li>
              {{ r.region }}: <strong [attr.data-testid]="'apexname-region-' + r.region">{{ r.name ?? 'n/a' }}</strong>
            </li>
          }
        </ul>
      }
    </section>
    <section aria-labelledby="band-counts-heading">
      <h2 id="band-counts-heading">People per band</h2>
      <ul>
        @for (b of bandCounts(); track b.band) {
          <li>
            {{ b.band }}: <strong [attr.data-testid]="'band-count-' + b.band">{{ b.count }}</strong>
          </li>
        }
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section aria-labelledby="tier-tally-heading">
      <h2 id="tier-tally-heading">People per tier</h2>
      <ul>
        @for (t of tierTally(); track t.tier) {
          <li>
            {{ t.tier }}: <strong [attr.data-testid]="'tier-tally-' + t.tier">{{ t.count }}</strong>
          </li>
        }
      </ul>
